o immunodeficient mice in the presence of the human cytokines BAFF and IL6, we observed increases in retention of plasma cells in the bone marrow, with engraftment exceeding a year. The most profound in vivo effects of human IL6 were observed within 20 days of transfer and could be explained by decreased apoptosis in newly differentiated plasma cells. Collectively, these results show that ex vivo engineered and differentiated human plasma cells have the potential for long-lived in vivo protein secretion, which can be modeled in small animals.","topics":[],"score":2350,"global_rank":81186},{"name":"shakani/azure-predictive-maintenance","owner":"shakani","html_url":"https://github.com/shakani/azure-predictive-maintenance","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2350,"global_rank":81193},{"name":"paul-shannon/jupyter-widget-demos","owner":"paul-shannon","html_url":"https://github.com/paul-shannon/jupyter-widget-demos","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"A simple jupyter notebook/lab widget exploration: d3 circles, reciprocal interactions","topics":[],"score":2349,"global_rank":81246},{"name":"arokem/2015-11-19-public-nidata","owner":"arokem","html_url":"https://github.com/arokem/2015-11-19-public-nidata","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2349,"global_rank":81267},{"name":"vasukumar92/Advanced-Data-Visualizations---Immigration-Data-and-Novel","owner":"vasukumar92","html_url":"https://github.com/vasukumar92/Advanced-Data-Visualizations---Immigration-Data-and-Novel","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Dataset: Immigration to Canada from 1980 to 2013 - International migration flows to and from selected countries - The 2015 revision from United Nation's website  The dataset contains annual data on the flows of internatio